The '''Windmill''' is a sub-location of {{Zone|The Barn}}. 

{{ZoneText|Talk to the Windmill Operator.}}

== Features ==
=== Windmill ===
The '''Windmill''' itself is a structure and the main attraction of the area. It hosts the {{NPCSprite|Windmill Operator}}, and contains a [[Fairy Souls|Fairy Soul]]. It serves no purpose whatsoever.

=== Windmill Operator ===
{{Main|Windmill Operator}}
The {{NPCSprite|Windmill Operator}} is an [[NPC]] located in the '''Windmill'''. They request {{Item|String|amount=64}} and {{Item|Cobblestone|amount=64}} respectively to "repair" the '''Windmill'''. After the player gives them the materials, the {{NPCSprite|Windmill Operator}} will offer the player the {{NPCSprite|Farm Merchant}}'s shop, with the exact same products sold.

